) 17... fxe4 18. dxe4 g5 19. Raf1 (19. Rxf8+ Rxf8 20. Rf1) (19. hxg5 Qh2+ 20. Kf1 Rxf3+ 21. Bxf3 Qf2#) 19... Rxf3?! { Inaccuracy. gxh4 was best. } (19... gxh4 20. Bh3 (20. Rxf8+ Rxf8 21. Rxf8+ Kxf8 22. gxh4 (22. Bf3 hxg3 23. Nxg3 Qh3 24. Qg2 Qxg2+ 25. Kxg2 Nxe3+ 26. Kf2 Nc4 27. b4 Nxa3) 22... Qxh4 23. Nc3 Qh2+ 24. Kf1 Qg3 25. Nd1 Bb5+ 26. Kg1 Qh2#) (20. Nf4) (20. gxh4 Qxh4) 20... Rxf3 21. Rxf3 Rf8 22. Bxg4 Bxg4 23. Rxf8+ Kxf8 24. gxh4 Qxh4 25. Qd1) 20. Bxf3 gxh4 21. Bxg4 Bxg4 22. Kg2? { Mistake. gxh4 was best. } (22. gxh4 Kh8 23. Ng3 Rg8 24. Qg2 Qxh4 25. Kf2 Rf8+ 26. Kg1 Rxf1+ 27. Nxf1 Bh3) 22... hxg3 23. Rh1?! { Inaccuracy. Kxg3 was best. } (23. Kxg3 Qh3+ 24. Kf2 Rf8+ 25. Nf4 exf4 26. exf4 Qf3+ 27. Kg1 Qxe4 28. Kh2 Bh5) (23. Nxg3) 23... Bf3+ 24. Kxf3 Qxh1+ 25. Kxg3 Rf8 26. Nc3? { Checkmate is now unavoidable. Nf4 was best. } (26. Nf4 exf4+ 27. exf4 Kf7 28. Kf2 Rg8 29. Qc3 Rg2+ 30. Ke3 Rg3+ 31. Kd4 (31. Kd2 Rxc3 32. bxc3 Qg2+) 31... Qg1+) 26... Rf3+ 27. Kg4 Qh3+ 28. Kg5 h6+ 29. Kg6 Qg4+ (29... Qg3+) 30. Kxh6 Rh3# { 0-1 Black wins by checkmate. } *

